hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,arabic,grades,reference,international_number,narrator_chain,chapter_intro}:
"41","سُبْـحانَ رَبِّـيَ الأَعْلـى. (ثلاث مرات)","","","","","When prostrating due to recitation of the Quran"
"42","سُبْـحانَكَ اللّهُـمَّ رَبَّـنا وَبِحَـمْدِكَ ، اللّهُـمَّ اغْفِرْ لي","","","","","When prostrating due to recitation of the Quran"
